        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Pittsburgh Penguins, New York Islanders\n- Seasons: 1981–82 Pittsburgh Penguins season, 1981–82 New York Islanders season\n- League: National Hockey League\n- Events: 1982 Stanley Cup playoffs, Stanley Cup\n\nFacts:\n- The 1981–82 Pittsburgh Penguins season was the Pittsburgh Penguins' 15th season in the National Hockey League.\n- During the 1981–82 season, the Pittsburgh Penguins qualified for the playoffs for the fourth straight year.\n- In the 1982 playoffs, the New York Islanders defeated the Pittsburgh Penguins three games to two in the opening round.\n- The New York Islanders went on to become the eventual Stanley Cup champions.\n- The 1981–82 New York Islanders season was the 10th season in New York Islanders franchise history.\n- The 1981–82 New York Islanders season ended with the team winning the Stanley Cup.",
